    {
      "id": "tf-would-i-say-for-owen",
      "title": {
        "en": "TF would I say for Owen"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Owen and Multi Attacks\nOwen has alot of cards such as Wind Charge or Wind Riding\nWhich adds hits to HIS OWN cards\nOwens Expensive high multiplier cards can use it semi effectively\nOwen also has Vulnerable\nA flat 1.5x Multiplier which is also good on high Multiplier cards\nHe's a pretty okay support to Characters with high Multipliers like Nine or Haru\nWith only a single hit mainly"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Honestly Rework this guy"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
